      <title>Africa Is the New Front in the Middle East’s Wars</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-07/africa-is-the-new-front-in-the-middle-east-s-wars</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">623680010e77b7ef23e1e9ba</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 05:00:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The battle for the Strait of Hormuz commands global attention, but keep an eye on the contested waterway west of the Arabian Peninsula as well. The entire Red Sea region is pulsing with rivalry; the combatants include great powers, nonstate actors and nearly everything in between. This corridor of conflict upsets global trade and roils regions spanning two continents. It may also offer a preview of broader disorder ahead.</description>
